The fast path returns `true` before the eth addrs write. But the slow path writes eth addrs before the IP parsing. So if the dissector requests `FLOW_DISSECTOR_KEY_ETH_ADDRS`, the fast path would skip that write, causing a divergence!

Wait, but the standard `flow_keys_dissector` - does it request `FLOW_DISSECTOR_KEY_ETH_ADDRS`? Let me check...

